    description: "Analyzer signature extraction currently strips generic type parameters (List<T>→List). For typed stable_id, signatures must preserve generics in a normalized form (e.g., List<$0> for positional type variables). Affects all languages with generics: Java, Kotlin, C#, TypeScript, Dart, Rust, Go (type parameters), etc."  # f492
